How can you say animals have a right to life? 

&amp;#x200B;

The only way to enforce that is to stop animals from killing each other, stop all pest control, stop all eating meat,  and either stop or at least attempt to limit any other unnatural causes of animal deaths. It's a stupid and dangerous idea given that New Zealand would be fucked pretty quickly if every animal had a right to live here.

&amp;#x200B;
